<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pronunciation Clinic — Introducing Yourself | Pazapa English for Adults</title>
<!--
  PAZAPA ENGLISH PROGRAMME FOR ADULTS
  Week 1 · Lesson 1 · Step 3 — PRONUNCIATION CLINIC
  Standalone Moodle activity. No external dependencies.

  MODEL AUDIO FILES — supplied, and expected in the same folder as this HTML:
    Hello_mp3.mp3              Hello.
    mynameisamina_mp3.mp3      My name is Amina.
    whatsyourname_mp3.mp3      What's your name?
    Imsamira_mp3.mp3           I'm Samira.
    imfromegypt_mp3.mp3        I'm from Egypt.
    whereareyoufrom_mp3.mp3    Where are you from?
    nicetomeetyou_mp3.mp3      Nice to meet you.
    nicetomeetyoutoo_mp3.mp3   Nice to meet you, too.
  If a file is missing, its player shows a visible notice naming it.
-->
<style>
  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     COLOUR — Pazapa brand guidelines, 2017–2018 edition, page 8.
     The six official colours are used unmodified:
       cyan #36BBD6 · lime #C9D646 · yellow #FCC104
       red  #E6352B · light grey #EBEBEB · dark grey #2E2E2D

     Only these six colours and their published 20/40/60/80% tints
     appear in this file. Nothing is darkened or mixed. Cyan, lime and
     yellow cannot carry small text on white, so they are used as
     fills with the brand dark grey on top — the way the guidelines
     set their own colour blocks. Ratios are noted per token (WCAG 2.2
     asks 4.5:1 on text, 3:1 on marks and control borders). Colour
     never carries meaning on its own.
     ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  :root{
    /* The palette, exactly as published */
    --brand-cyan:   #36BBD6;
    --brand-lime:   #C9D646;
    --brand-yellow: #FCC104;
    --brand-red:    #E6352B;
    --brand-grey:   #EBEBEB;
    --brand-ink:    #2E2E2D;

    /* Roles. Every value below is either a 100% brand colour or one of
       the 80/60/40/20% tints printed beside it on page 8. No colour is
       darkened, blended or invented. Where a brand colour cannot carry
       text — cyan is 2.3:1 on white, yellow 1.6:1 — it is used as a
       fill with the brand dark grey on top, which is how the palette
       is shown in the guidelines themselves. */
    --ink:         var(--brand-ink);  /* body text — 13.6:1 on card */
    --ink-soft:    #585857;           /* dark grey 80% — 7.1:1 on card */
    --paper:       var(--brand-grey); /* page background */
    --card:        #FFFFFF;
    --wash:        #D7F1F7;           /* cyan 20% — players and panels */
    --line:        #D5D5D5;           /* dark grey 20% — decorative rules */
    --line-strong: #828281;           /* dark grey 60% — control borders, 3.9:1 */
    --beat:        var(--line-strong);/* unstressed rhythm marks */

    --cyan-80:     #5EC9DE;  /* cyan 80% — button hover */
    --cyan-20:     var(--wash);
    --yellow-20:   #FEF3CD;  /* yellow 20% — placeholder notices */

    --on-cyan:     var(--brand-ink); /* dark grey on cyan — 6.0:1 */

    --radius:      14px;
    --shadow:      0 1px 2px rgba(46,46,45,.07), 0 8px 24px rgba(46,46,45,.07);
  }

  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------
     TYPE — Pazapa brand guidelines, page 11.
     Headings: Filson Soft Black. The guidelines state that all-capital
     headings are not permitted, so nothing in this file is set in
     capitals except the single stressed word inside a practice
     phrase, which is a pronunciation mark rather than a heading.
     Body: Open Sans, in several weights.
     Mark My Words is reserved for print advertising copy and
     signatures, so it is not used in this activity.

     Neither face is a system font. Place the licensed WOFF2 files
     beside this HTML and uncomment the @font-face block below; both
     will then load offline inside Moodle with no external request.
     Until then the stacks fall back to the nearest rounded geometric
     and humanist sans the learner's device already has.

     The scale is rem-based on a 17px root, so browser zoom and
     "larger text" settings scale the whole interface. Nothing is set
     below --t-micro (14.9px), and target language never below
     --t-phrase (21px).
     ------------------------------------------------------------------ */

  /*
  @font-face{ font-family:"Filson Soft"; src:url("FilsonSoft-Black.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight:900; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
  @font-face{ font-family:"Open Sans"; src:url("OpenSans-Regular.woff2")  format("woff2"); font-weight:400; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
  @font-face{ font-family:"Open Sans"; src:url("OpenSans-SemiBold.woff2") format("woff2"); font-weight:600; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
  @font-face{ font-family:"Open Sans"; src:url("OpenSans-Bold.woff2")     format("woff2"); font-weight:700; font-style:normal; font-display:swap; }
  @font-face{ font-family:"Open Sans"; src:url("OpenSans-Italic.woff2")   format("woff2"); font-weight:400; font-style:italic; font-display:swap; }
  */

  :root{
    --display:  "Filson Soft", "Filson Soft Black", Nunito, "Varela Round", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
    --body:     "Open Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;
    --mono:     ui-monospace, "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;

    --t-micro:  .875rem;   /* 14.9px — labels, captions, status lines */
    --t-small:  .95rem;    /* 16.2px — French support, small buttons */
    --t-base:   1rem;      /* 17px — body copy and controls */
    --t-lead:   1.12rem;   /* 19px — opening lines, dialogue lines */
    --t-phrase: 1.24rem;   /* 21px — target language in cards and chunks */
    --t-h3:     1.06rem;
    --t-h2:     1.5rem;
    --t-h1:     2rem;
    --t-h1-sm:  1.65rem;
    --t-target: clamp(1.55rem, 5.2vw, 2.15rem);  /* the expression under practice */

    --lh-tight: 1.2;
    --lh-body:  1.6;       /* generous leading for A1 reading */
    --lh-target:1.5;

    --w-normal: 400;
    --w-medium: 600;
    --w-bold:   700;
    --w-display:900;       /* Filson Soft Black */
    --w-stress: 800;       /* the stressed word only */

    --track-label:.04em;
    --track-tag:  .03em;

    --measure:  64ch;      /* prose never runs wider than this */
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }

  html{ font-size:106.25%; }            /* 17px root: the whole scale zooms with it */
  html,body{ margin:0; padding:0; }

  body{
    font-family:var(--body);
    color:var(--ink);
    background:var(--paper);
    font-size:var(--t-base);
    line-height:var(--lh-body);
    -webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;
    text-rendering:optimizeLegibility;
  }

  /* ---------- Header ---------- */
  .site{
    background:var(--brand-cyan);
    color:var(--on-cyan);
    padding:14px 20px;
  }
  .site-inner{
    max-width:840px; margin:0 auto;
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:baseline; gap:6px 16px;
  }
  .brand{
    font-size:var(--t-micro); font-weight:var(--w-bold);
    letter-spacing:var(--track-label);
    color:var(--on-cyan);
  }
  .lesson{ font-family:var(--display); font-weight:var(--w-display); font-size:var(--t-h3); }
  .step-tag{
    margin-left:auto;
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--card);
    color:var(--ink);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:4px 14px;
    font-size:var(--t-micro); font-weight:var(--w-medium); letter-spacing:var(--track-tag);
    white-space:nowrap;
  }

  /* ---------- Progress ---------- */
  .progress{
    background:var(--card);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:10px 20px 8px;
  }
  .progress-inner{ max-width:840px; margin:0 auto; }
  .track{ height:6px; background:var(--line); border-radius:999px; overflow:hidden; }
  .fill{ display:block; height:100%; width:6.25%; background:var(--brand-cyan); border-radius:999px; transition:width .3s ease; }
  /* the bar is decorative — the same progress is stated in words beside it */
  .counter{ font-size:var(--t-micro); color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:6px; letter-spacing:.03em; }

  /* ---------- Layout ---------- */
  main{ max-width:840px; margin:0 auto; padding:26px 20px 20px; }

  .screen{
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:var(--radius);
    box-shadow:var(--shadow);
    padding:30px 28px 34px;
  }
  .screen[hidden]{ display:none; }

  .eyebrow{
    font-size:var(--t-micro); font-weight:var(--w-bold);
    letter-spacing:var(--track-label);
    color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 10px;
  }

  h1,h2{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:var(--w-display);
    line-height:var(--lh-tight); margin:0 0 14px;
    text-wrap:balance;
  }
  /* the lime square the brand guidelines set before every heading */
  h1::before, h2::before{
    content:""; display:inline-block;
    width:.46em; height:.46em; margin-right:.4em;
    background:var(--brand-lime);
    vertical-align:.04em;
  }
  h1{ font-size:var(--t-h1); letter-spacing:-.01em; }
  h2{ font-size:var(--t-h2); }
  h3{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--t-h3); font-weight:var(--w-display); margin:26px 0 10px; }
  .screen-title:focus{ outline:3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset:6px; border-radius:4px; }
  .screen-title:focus:not(:focus-visible){ outline:none; }

  p{ margin:0 0 14px; max-width:var(--measure); text-wrap:pretty; }
  .lead{ font-size:var(--t-lead); color:var(--ink); }
  .quiet{ color:var(--ink-soft); }
  .fr{ font-style:italic; color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:var(--t-small); }
  .small{ font-size:var(--t-micro); }

  .say{
    font-family:var(--display); font-weight:var(--w-display);
    font-size:var(--t-phrase);
    border-left:5px solid var(--brand-cyan);
    padding:2px 0 2px 16px;
    margin:0 0 18px;
    color:var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------- Target expression + rhythm signature ---------- */
  .target{
    font-size:var(--t-target);
    font-weight:var(--w-medium);
    letter-spacing:.005em;
    line-height:var(--lh-target);
    max-width:none;
    margin:6px 0 20px;
  }
  .target .w{
    display:inline-block;
    position:relative;
    padding-bottom:16px;
    margin:0 .34em 6px 0;
  }
  .target .w::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; left:0; right:0; bottom:4px;
    height:3px; border-radius:2px;
    background:var(--beat);
  }
  .target .w.strong{
    font-weight:var(--w-stress);
    background:var(--brand-yellow);   /* dark grey on brand yellow — 8.3:1 */
    border-radius:5px;
    padding:0 .16em;
  }
  .target .w.strong::after{ height:9px; bottom:3px; background:var(--ink); }
  .rhythm-key{
    font-size:var(--t-micro); color:var(--ink-soft);
    border-top:1px dashed var(--line);
    padding-top:10px; margin-top:-4px;
  }

  .chunks{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin:0 0 18px; padding:0; list-style:none; }
  .chunks li{
    background:var(--wash);
    border:1px solid var(--brand-cyan);
    color:var(--ink);
    border-radius:10px;
    padding:9px 16px;
    font-size:var(--t-phrase); font-weight:var(--w-medium);
  }

  /* ---------- Audio player ---------- */
  .player{
    background:var(--wash);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:14px 16px;
    margin:0 0 20px;
  }
  .player-buttons{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }
  .status{ margin:10px 0 0; font-size:var(--t-micro); color:var(--ink-soft); min-height:1.2em; }

  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */
  .btn{
    font-family:var(--body);
    font-size:var(--t-base); font-weight:var(--w-medium);
    min-height:48px; min-width:48px;
    padding:11px 20px;
    border-radius:10px;
    border:1px solid transparent;
    cursor:pointer;
    background:var(--brand-cyan); color:var(--on-cyan);
    transition:background .15s ease, border-color .15s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover{ background:var(--cyan-80); }
  .btn-ghost{ background:var(--card); color:var(--ink); border:2px solid var(--brand-cyan); }
  .btn-ghost:hover{ background:var(--wash); }
  .btn-wide{ width:100%; max-width:340px; }
  .btn:focus-visible{ outline:3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset:3px; }
  .btn[disabled]{ opacity:.45; cursor:not-allowed; }
  .btn[disabled]:hover{ background:var(--brand-cyan); }
  .btn-ghost[disabled]:hover{ background:var(--card); }

  /* ---------- Cards grid ---------- */
  .cards{ display:grid; gap:14px; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(255px, 1fr)); margin-bottom:8px; }
  .card{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:12px;
    padding:16px;
    background:var(--wash);
  }
  .card .phrase{ font-size:var(--t-phrase); font-weight:var(--w-bold); margin:0 0 12px; }
  .card .player{ margin:0; padding:0; border:0; background:none; }

  .feedback{
    border-radius:12px; padding:14px 16px; font-size:var(--t-base); max-width:var(--measure);
    border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--wash);
  }
  .feedback[hidden]{ display:none; }
  .feedback strong{ display:block; margin-bottom:2px; }

  /* ---------- Dialogue ---------- */
  .dialogue{ list-style:none; margin:0 0 20px; padding:0; }
  .dialogue li{
    display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:10px 14px;
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:12px 2px;
  }
  .dialogue li:last-child{ border-bottom:0; }
  .who{
    font-weight:var(--w-bold); color:var(--ink);
    min-width:5.2em; flex:none;
  }
  .line{ flex:1 1 220px; font-size:var(--t-lead); }
  .dialogue .btn{ font-size:var(--t-small); padding:9px 14px; }

  /* ---------- Checklist ---------- */
  .checklist{ list-style:none; margin:0 0 18px; padding:0; }
  .checklist li{ margin-bottom:6px; }
  .checklist label{
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
    padding:12px 14px; border:1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius:12px;
    background:var(--wash); cursor:pointer; min-height:48px; font-size:var(--t-base);
  }
  .checklist input{ width:22px; height:22px; accent-color:var(--brand-cyan); flex:none; }
  .checklist input:focus-visible{ outline:3px solid var(--ink); outline-offset:3px; }

  /* ---------- Recording ---------- */
  .rec-buttons{ display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px; }
  .rec-dot{
    display:inline-block; width:10px; height:10px; border-radius:50%;
    background:var(--rec); margin-right:8px; vertical-align:middle;
  }
  audio.playback{ width:100%; max-width:420px; margin-top:6px; }

  /* ---------- Steps list on completion ---------- */
  .ready{
    border:2px solid var(--brand-cyan); background:var(--wash);
    border-radius:12px; padding:16px 18px; margin:0 0 20px;
    font-size:var(--t-lead); font-weight:var(--w-bold); color:var(--ink);
  }

  /* ---------- Nav ---------- */
  .navbar{
    position:sticky; bottom:0;
    background:var(--card);
    border-top:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:12px 20px calc(12px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px));
  }
  .navbar-inner{
    max-width:840px; margin:0 auto;
    display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center;
  }
  .navbar .btn-next, .navbar .btn-done{ margin-left:auto; }
  .navbar [hidden]{ display:none; }

  .skip{
    position:absolute; left:-9999px;
    background:var(--card); color:var(--ink); padding:10px 16px; z-index:10; border-radius:0 0 8px 0;
  }
  .skip:focus{ left:0; top:0; }

  @media (max-width:520px){
    .screen{ padding:24px 18px 28px; }
    h1{ font-size:var(--t-h1-sm); }
    .step-tag{ margin-left:0; }
    .btn{ padding:11px 16px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; scroll-behavior:auto !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to the activity</a>

<header class="site">
  <div class="site-inner">
    <span class="brand">Pazapa English · Adults</span>
    <span class="lesson">Week 1 · Lesson 1 — Introducing Yourself</span>
    <span class="step-tag">Step 3 · Pronunciation Clinic</span>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="progress">
  <div class="progress-inner">
    <div class="track"><span class="fill" id="progressFill"></span></div>
    <p class="counter" id="counter" role="status" aria-live="polite">Screen 1 of 16</p>
  </div>
</div>

<main id="main">

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 1 — WELCOME ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s1" aria-label="Welcome">
    <p class="eyebrow">Step 3 of 7</p>
    <h1 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">Pronunciation Clinic</h1>
    <p class="lead">Now let’s practise saying the English clearly.</p>
    <p class="fr" lang="fr">Entraînez-vous à prononcer clairement l’anglais utile.</p>


    <p class="say"><strong>Listen. Repeat. Speak clearly.</strong></p>
    <p class="quiet">You can play every model as many times as you want. Nothing here is scored.</p>


    <button type="button" class="btn btn-wide" data-next>Start pronunciation practice</button>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 2 — LISTEN AND REPEAT ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s2" hidden aria-label="Expression 1">
    <p class="eyebrow">Expression 1</p>
    <h2 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">Hello.</h2>

    <p class="lead">Listen first.</p>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="hello" aria-label="Listen to the model of Hello">▶ Listen</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="hello" aria-label="Play the model of Hello again">↻ Repeat</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <p class="say">Now say it.</p>
    <p class="quiet">Say <strong>Hello.</strong> out loud, or quietly to yourself. Play the model again whenever you want.</p>
    <p class="fr" lang="fr">Vous pouvez réécouter autant de fois que nécessaire.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 3 — WORD STRESS ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s3" hidden aria-label="Word stress">
    <p class="eyebrow">Noticing</p>
    <h2 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">Which word sounds stronger?</h2>
    <p>In natural English, one important word can sound stronger.</p>

    <p class="target"><span class="w">My</span><span class="w strong">NAME</span><span class="w">is</span><span class="w">Amina.</span></p>
    <p class="rhythm-key">The thick line marks the stronger word.</p>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="myNameIsAmina" aria-label="Listen to the model of My name is Amina">▶ Listen</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="myNameIsAmina" aria-label="Play the model of My name is Amina again">↻ Repeat</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <p class="quiet">Now say it with the strong word: <strong>My NAME is Amina.</strong></p>

    <h3>The same idea again</h3>
    <p class="target"><span class="w strong">NICE</span><span class="w">to</span><span class="w">meet</span><span class="w">you.</span></p>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="niceToMeetYou" aria-label="Listen to the model of Nice to meet you">▶ Listen</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="niceToMeetYou" aria-label="Play the model of Nice to meet you again">↻ Repeat</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
    <p class="quiet">Listen, then repeat.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 4 — EXPRESSION 2 ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s4" hidden aria-label="Expression 2">
    <p class="eyebrow">Expression 2</p>
    <h2 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">My name is Amina.</h2>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="myNameIsAmina" aria-label="Listen to the whole sentence, My name is Amina">▶ Listen to the whole sentence</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="myNameIsAmina" aria-label="Play the sentence My name is Amina again">↻ Repeat</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <h3>In two parts</h3>
    <ul class="chunks">
      <li>My name</li>
      <li>is Amina.</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="say">Say it with me.</p>
    <p class="quiet">Play the model and speak at the same time.</p>

    <p class="say">Now say it alone.</p>
    <p class="quiet">Take your time. Play the model again if you need it.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 5 — EXPRESSION 3 ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s5" hidden aria-label="Expression 3">
    <p class="eyebrow">Expression 3</p>
    <h2 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">What’s your name?</h2>

    <p class="target"><span class="w">What’s</span><span class="w">your</span><span class="w strong">NAME?</span></p>
    <p>The important word is <strong>NAME</strong>.</p>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="whatsYourName" aria-label="Listen to the model of What's your name">▶ Listen</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="whatsYourName" aria-label="Play the model of What's your name again">↻ Repeat</button>
      </div>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>

    <p class="quiet">Listen, then repeat. You can play this as many times as you like.</p>
    <p class="fr" lang="fr">Écoutez, puis répétez.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- ============ SCREEN 6 — EXPRESSION 4 ============ -->
  <section class="screen" id="s6" hidden aria-label="Expression 4">
    <p class="eyebrow">Expression 4</p>
    <h2 class="screen-title" tabindex="-1">I’m from Egypt.</h2>

    <p class="target"><span class="w">I’m</span><span class="w strong">FROM</span><span class="w strong">EGYPT.</span></p>

    <ul class="chunks">
      <li>I’m</li>
      <li>from</li>
      <li>Egypt.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="player">
      <div class="player-buttons">
        <button type="button" class="btn" data-sound="imFromEgypt" aria-label="Listen to the model of I'm from Egypt">▶ Listen</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost" data-sound="imFromEgypt" aria-label="Play the model of I'm from Egypt again">↻ Repeat</button>
